{"id":"sk-0306","type":"quote","title":"人的最大欢乐就是人的诞生","source":"xuan-ji-zh-vol2","topics":["family-school","love-education"],"tags":[],"ref":"《怎样培养真正的人》 / 最大的欢乐就是人的诞生 / <!-- OCR 原PDF页段: p0200-0299 (0-based) -->","cn":"苏霍姆林斯基把新生命的诞生视为“人民的未来，父母的欢乐”，并主张培养孩子对待人的诞生、对待孕妇和母亲的高尚态度——这既是在培养孩子，也是在培养未来的父亲和母亲。","excerpt":"人的最大欢乐就是人的诞生。要知道，你的问世，是你父母最大的欢乐。","excerpts":["人的最大欢乐就是人的诞生。要知道，你的问世，是你父母最大的欢乐。"],"created":"2026-09-07","updated":"2026-09-07","prev":"sk-0305","next":"sk-0307","related":[{"id":"sk-0387","title":"教孩子学会爱父母，是父母最重要的哲理","type":"quote","topics":["family-school","love-education"],"primary":"A8","primary_name":"家庭与母亲"},{"id":"sk-1002","title":"父母在孩子生活中的作用","type":"principle","topics":["family-school","love-education","child-study"],"primary":"A8","primary_name":"家庭与母亲"},{"id":"sk-1188","title":"培养尊敬爷爷奶奶的情感","type":"method","topics":["family-school","love-education","collective-education"],"primary":"A8","primary_name":"家庭与母亲"},{"id":"sk-1222","title":"怎样和家长一道培养未来的母亲和父亲","type":"method","topics":["family-school","love-education"],"primary":"A8","primary_name":"家庭与母亲"},{"id":"sk-1249","title":"父母在孩子生活中的作用","type":"practice","topics":["family-school","love-education","labor-education"],"primary":"A8","primary_name":"家庭与母亲"},{"id":"sk-1309","title":"致父亲们的话","type":"practice","topics":["family-school","love-education","child-study"],"primary":"A8","primary_name":"家庭与母亲"}],"primary":"A19","seealso":["A8"],"primary_name":"道德判断与品德培养","seealso_names":["家庭与母亲"],"tag_names":[]}